7 cases including identical/very-different inputs, early-exit (low total), tiny lengths (1, 2).\n- `match_thresholds_sweep` — 21 thresholds 0.0…1.0 over 64-bin synthetic signals.\n\n**Symbol parity:** Both `.so` files export `match` and `spectral_contrast`. The C `_init`/`_fini` are linker-emitted, not user APIs.\n\n**Results:**\n- `cargo check` (default & `--no-default-features`): clean\n- `cargo test` (debug): 3/3 pass\n- `cargo test --release`: 3/3 pass"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":233,"cache_read_input_tokens":42741,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":233,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2c8b7703-e05e-451a-a748-7dd4b432ab08","uuid":"3ff8bec5-bc84-4495-8109-a0f1aab5e43c"}
